# r1112 Hearth and Harvest Gear: batch-fault reruns from r1111 (verdicts perf/runs/r1111/verdicts/hh_gear.md, hh_boot45.md).
# One boot, group A superflat (ground top y -61, stand at -60), spawn-animals=true (horses; as the r1111 hhm world).
# Setup before boot: copy tools/scratch_query/zq_probe.js and hh_gear_probe.js to srv/kubejs/server_scripts/ as
#   zz_zq_probe.js and zz_hh_gear_probe.js (both changed for r1112: zq potion prints the registry id; zhh5 hurt prints
#   shod and the bare LivingAttackEvent result; zhh5 horse prints ground=).
# Not here: SQ-HH-1500 (PASS r1111 boot 4); -1551 (toml read only at boot: needs a two-boot row); -1524, -1529, -1590
#   (row-text faults, rejudge); -1607 to -1611 (Quark Simple Harvest takes the click, real-player rows); -1574, -1575
#   (Quark seed pouch dispenser: crashes the server, known FAIL).
# Hops rows: the farmland under a hops column dries and turns to dirt (HopsLatticeBlock is not IPlantable, so FarmBlock
#   does not count it as a crop): possible mod gap, the rows keep it wet with a water source beside it. Lattices need a
#   solid block behind them (facing north: z+1; facing east: x-1). Season set to autumn (hops are autumn_fruit).
pace 1

## SQ-HH-1505s | setup: area, bot, clear old horses and items (not a test row)
> forceload add 470 460 620 620
> gamerule doMobSpawning false
> gamerule doDaylightCycle false
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 3
> time set noon
> kill @e[type=minecraft:horse]
> kill @e[type=minecraft:item]
> pbot spawn G 500 -60 490 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 3
> clear G
> zhh5 hand G
look setup; `[zhh5] hand id=minecraft:air`, no probe error

## SQ-HH-1505 | zh1 `accepted=false`, health unchanged both times; zh2 `accepted=true`
> summon minecraft:horse 480 -60 476 {Tame:1b,NoAI:1b,Tags:["r2h1"]}
> summon minecraft:horse 484 -60 476 {Tame:1b,NoAI:1b,Tags:["r2h2"]}
> pbot hold G hearthandharvest:horseshoe 1
> zhh5 interact G r2h1
> zhh5 horse r2h1
> zhh5 horse r2h2
> zhh5 hurt r2h1 cactus
sleep 1
> zhh5 hurt r2h1 berry
sleep 1
> zhh5 hurt r2h2 cactus
reject error TypeError
look r2h1 (shod, `shod=true` in the horse line) `accepted=false`, health unchanged both times, `attackEventPasses=false`; r2h2 (unshod control) `accepted=true`, health down 1, `attackEventPasses=true`. If r2h1 shows shod=true, attackEventPasses=false but accepted=true: the probe's attack path skips the Forge event (BATCH-FAULT, mod fine); attackEventPasses=true with shod=true: real FAIL (HorseshoeEvents.onAttack)

## SQ-HH-1506 | on soul sand mods holds `Horseshoe grip`, value about 1.5 (1 / 0.4 - 1
> summon minecraft:horse 488 -60 476 {Tame:1b,NoAI:1b,OnGround:1b,Tags:["r2h3"]}
> pbot hold G hearthandharvest:horseshoe 1
> zhh5 interact G r2h3
> zhh5 horse r2h3
> setblock 488 -61 476 minecraft:soul_sand
sleep 2
> zhh5 horse r2h3
> setblock 488 -61 476 minecraft:grass_block
sleep 2
> zhh5 horse r2h3
look first line `shod=true ground=true`; on soul sand mods holds `Horseshoe grip`, value about 1.5 (1 / 0.4 - 1); on grass it is gone, `Horseshoe=0.25` stays. If ground=false the OnGround tag did not hold on a NoAI horse (BATCH-FAULT again, not a mod FAIL)

