# Hops rows: wet farmland (water source beside it), stone behind every lattice, autumn, randomTickSpeed 1000 (3000 put
# the r1111 server 22 s behind). Growth checks poll, since hops never lose age or height once grown.
## SQ-HH-1550 | "Test passed" (HNH-76). In winter a Creative Calendar season may stop
> season set MID_AUTUMN
> setblock 505 -61 520 minecraft:water
> setblock 506 -61 520 minecraft:farmland[moisture=7]
> setblock 506 -60 521 minecraft:stone
> setblock 506 -60 520 hearthandharvest:hops[age=0,facing=north]
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 1000
repeat 6
sleep 3
> execute if block 506 -60 520 hearthandharvest:hops[age=4,facing=north]
end
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 3
> execute if block 506 -61 520 minecraft:farmland
count Test passed >= 2
look a poll "Test passed" (age 4, HNH-76) and the farmland still there at the end. All polls failing with the farmland still there: check the season line (`season set` output) before calling it a FAIL

